        {
         "id": "660060b3",
         "settings": {
          "editor": "<p>At <b>Lenz Heating &amp; Cooling</b>, we love giving back to Central Iowa by helping our neighbors stay comfortable, save energy, and protect their homes. That’s why we regularly join the team on <b>WHO 13 News' Hello Iowa!</b> to break down complex HVAC topics into plain, simple advice you can use at home.</p><p>Whether we're breaking down how to prepare your furnace for winter, sharing energy-saving hacks, or talking about what sets our family-owned business apart, our goal is always to make home comfort simple and stress-free.</p>",
          "_css_classes": "hero__sub"
         },
         "elements": [],
         "isInner": true,
         "widgetType": "text-editor",
         "elType": "widget"
        },
